   "state": "federal",
   "date": "2023-05-10",
   "stage_hint": null,
   "brief": "The Defence Legislation Amendment (Naval Nuclear Propulsion) Bill 2023 clarifies that the moratorium on civil nuclear power does not prevent regulators from performing functions related to conventionally armed nuclear-powered submarines and their infrastructure. The speaker also announced the planned establishment of a new Australian Nuclear-Powered Submarine Safety Regulator later in 2023."
  }
